# width: 80
# height: 24
# The launcher dock on the RIGHT edge, auto-hiding, with a long file and
# the tree off, so the editor's vertical scrollbar is the control
# nearest that edge.
#
# The dock's band is its own three columns whether the strip is up or
# down, so the editor — and its scrollbar — ends where the band begins,
# and every row of the painted bar scrolls. Before the side-band rule
# the editor ran to the screen's last column and the dock's grip
# registered a hit three ROWS tall on it: a press on the middle of the
# bar pinned the dock and the view never moved
# (hunt/findings-2026-09-21/mouse-side-edge-grip-eats-scrollbar.md).
write long.txt "L000\nL001\nL002\nL003\nL004\nL005\nL006\nL007\nL008\nL009\nL010\nL011\nL012\nL013\nL014\nL015\nL016\nL017\nL018\nL019\nL020\nL021\nL022\nL023\nL024\nL025\nL026\nL027\nL028\nL029\nL030\nL031\nL032\nL033\nL034\nL035\nL036\nL037\nL038\nL039\nL040\nL041\nL042\nL043\nL044\nL045\nL046\nL047\nL048\nL049\nL050\nL051\nL052\nL053\nL054\nL055\nL056\nL057\nL058\nL059\nL060\nL061\nL062\nL063\nL064\nL065\nL066\nL067\nL068\nL069\nL070\nL071\nL072\nL073\nL074\nL075\nL076\nL077\nL078\nL079\nL080\nL081\nL082\nL083\nL084\nL085\nL086\nL087\nL088\nL089\nL090\nL091\nL092\nL093\nL094\nL095\nL096\nL097\nL098\nL099\nL100\nL101\nL102\nL103\nL104\nL105\nL106\nL107\nL108\nL109\nL110\nL111\nL112\nL113\nL114\nL115\nL116\nL117\nL118\nL119\nL120\nL121\nL122\nL123\nL124\nL125\nL126\nL127\nL128\nL129\nL130\nL131\nL132\nL133\nL134\nL135\nL136\nL137\nL138\nL139\nL140\nL141\nL142\nL143\nL144\nL145\nL146\nL147\nL148\nL149\nL150\nL151\nL152\nL153\nL154\nL155\nL156\nL157\nL158\nL159\nL160\nL161\nL162\nL163\nL164\nL165\nL166\nL167\nL168\nL169\nL170\nL171\nL172\nL173\nL174\nL175\nL176\nL177\nL178\nL179\nL180\nL181\nL182\nL183\nL184\nL185\nL186\nL187\nL188\nL189\nL190\nL191\nL192\nL193\nL194\nL195\nL196\nL197\nL198\nL199\n"
open long.txt
command view.toggle_tree
ex dock always
ex dock right
ex dock auto
expect screen contains "L000"
# The screen's last column is the dock's band, off its grip's cells. A
# press there pins nothing and moves nothing.
click 79 11
wait 300
expect screen lacks "dock pinned"
expect screen contains "L000"
# The scrollbar's own column, on the very row the grip used to own.
click 76 11
wait 300
expect screen lacks "L000"
